  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37213802",
      "title": "Extracting Entered Values",
      "lectureOrder": 218,
      "videoOrder": 202,
      "sourceHash": "afcc24b4f3254cb1f225447789ee6e74f4f83801c71d2aa1cad30841ac555e5a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 7.22,
          "en": "So now we can validate and also reset the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.29,
          "end": 9.81,
          "en": "Of course, one crucial thing is missing, though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.81,
          "end": 13.29,
          "en": "and that's submitting or saving the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.29,
          "end": 15.153,
          "en": "and we can of course also do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.23,
          "end": 17.94,
          "en": "Now to save the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.94,
          "end": 20.61,
          "en": "and get access to the entered values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.61,
          "end": 24.42,
          "en": "we can again use the formKey and there the currentState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.42,
          "end": 26.103,
          "en": "and then call the save method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.97,
          "end": 29.07,
          "en": "Now when calling the save method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.07,
          "end": 31.32,
          "en": "a special function will be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.32,
          "end": 33.39,
          "en": "on all these form field widgets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.39,
          "end": 36.033,
          "en": "inside the form like this TextFormField.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.17,
          "end": 39.15,
          "en": "The special function that will be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.15,
          "end": 44.15,
          "en": "is the onSaved function, so a function you pass",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.4,
          "end": 46.983,
          "en": "to the onSaved parameter value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.33,
          "end": 51.3,
          "en": "Now onSaved is a function that receives the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.3,
          "end": 54.24,
          "en": "that was entered as an argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.24,
          "end": 56.43,
          "en": "and this will be the value at the point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.43,
          "end": 58.42,
          "en": "of time save is executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.4,
          "end": 61.02,
          "en": "and then in here you can do with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.02,
          "end": 62.883,
          "en": "that value whatever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.75,
          "end": 66.93,
          "en": "For example, to get access to it and use it along",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.93,
          "end": 69.99,
          "en": "with all the other form values that have been entered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.99,
          "end": 72.51,
          "en": "you can add a new variable here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.51,
          "end": 74.01,
          "en": "and that could be the enteredName,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.01,
          "end": 76.31,
          "en": "which initially is an empty string, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.37,
          "end": 80.91,
          "en": "and you can set this enteredName to a new value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.91,
          "end": 83.61,
          "en": "the currently set value inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.61,
          "end": 85.923,
          "en": "of this onSaved function like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.09,
          "end": 89.28,
          "en": "Now here we must add an exclamation mark",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.28,
          "end": 92.19,
          "en": "to make it clear that value will not be null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.19,
          "end": 95.22,
          "en": "Alternatively, you could also add an extra check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.22,
          "end": 98.55,
          "en": "and for example, return if value should be null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.55,
          "end": 101.55,
          "en": "In that case, this code would not execute,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.55,
          "end": 104.16,
          "en": "but this is redundant and not needed here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.16,
          "end": 106.71000000000001,
          "en": "because we already have our validation logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.71000000000001,
          "end": 109.41,
          "en": "where we check if value is null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109.41,
          "end": 111.06,
          "en": "Therefore we should only call",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 111.06,
          "end": 114.03,
          "en": "that save method if validation fails.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 114.03,
          "end": 116.03999999999999,
          "en": "And to make sure that that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 116.03999999999999,
          "end": 120.3,
          "en": "we can wrap this validate call here into an if statement.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 120.3,
          "end": 123.24,
          "en": "So use it as a condition in a if statement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 123.24,
          "end": 126.87,
          "en": "because as mentioned before, validate returns a boolean",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.87,
          "end": 130.26,
          "en": "and it returns true if validation succeeds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.26,
          "end": 132.48,
          "en": "and false otherwise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.48,
          "end": 135.45,
          "en": "And then we can move this save method call here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.45,
          "end": 138.75,
          "en": "into this if statement so that we only run this code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.75,
          "end": 140.7,
          "en": "if validate returns true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 140.7,
          "end": 142.95,
          "en": "which as mentioned will only be the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.95,
          "end": 145.26,
          "en": "if validation succeeds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 145.26,
          "end": 147.39,
          "en": "Therefore, we'll then also know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 147.39,
          "end": 150.9,
          "en": "that in all our onSaved functions like this one here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 150.9,
          "end": 153.3,
          "en": "the value will be valid because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 153.3,
          "end": 154.89,
          "en": "otherwise we wouldn't call save",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 154.89,
          "end": 158.13,
          "en": "and this onSaved function here wouldn't get called.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.13,
          "end": 159.99,
          "en": "That's why we know with certainty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 159.99,
          "end": 162.273,
          "en": "that value here will not be null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 163.17000000000002,
          "end": 166.68,
          "en": "We also don't need to wrap this with setState here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166.68,
          "end": 168.42000000000002,
          "en": "because actually I don't need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 168.42000000000002,
          "end": 170.97,
          "en": "the build method to execute again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 170.97,
          "end": 173.52,
          "en": "I don't have any UI update",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 173.52,
          "end": 175.74,
          "en": "that should be performed because of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 175.74,
          "end": 180.74,
          "en": "I just wanna store the value in a property of my class here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 181.02,
          "end": 184.92,
          "en": "because that then allows me to use that property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 184.92,
          "end": 189.363,
          "en": "after calling save, for example, to print the enteredName.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 190.95,
          "end": 193.92,
          "en": "And here you will see that this will print the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 193.92,
          "end": 198.66,
          "en": "that has been entered because it's set here by calling save",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 198.66,
          "end": 201.54,
          "en": "because that executes this onSaved function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 201.54,
          "end": 204.53,
          "en": "where we do set the value and therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 204.53,
          "end": 208.233,
          "en": "in the next line thereafter, enteredName will be available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 209.37,
          "end": 211.07999999999998,
          "en": "Hence if I save this and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 211.07999999999998,
          "end": 215.13,
          "en": "you will see that if I go back here and I enter test",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 215.13,
          "end": 216.453,
          "en": "and I click add item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 217.71,
          "end": 220.41,
          "en": "if I then take a look at my debug console,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 220.41,
          "end": 222.31,
          "en": "I see my value here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 223.32,
          "end": 225.48,
          "en": "and that's how you can get saved access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 225.48,
          "end": 227.19299999999998,
          "en": "to the entered values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 228.18,
          "end": 232.07999999999998,
          "en": "Now of course we can repeat this for the enteredQuantity,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 232.07999999999998,
          "end": 234.12,
          "en": "but here I wanna get a number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 234.12,
          "end": 237.32999999999998,
          "en": "and I'll have an initial value of one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 237.32999999999998,
          "end": 242.01,
          "en": "And we cannot use this quantity to set the initial value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 242.01,
          "end": 244.974,
          "en": "We'll just have to make sure that we call toString",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 244.974,
          "end": 248.01,
          "en": "to convert this to a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 248.01,
          "end": 250.74,
          "en": "But even more importantly, we can then also use it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 250.74,
          "end": 254.79,
          "en": "to store the entered value once save is called.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 254.79,
          "end": 257.55,
          "en": "For that we add onSaved here as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 257.55,
          "end": 260.04,
          "en": "to this second TextFormField,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 260.04,
          "end": 262.53,
          "en": "the quantity TextFormField.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 262.53,
          "end": 266.16,
          "en": "And we get our value here, but this value will be a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 266.16,
          "end": 267.6,
          "en": "It always is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 267.6,
          "end": 271.203,
          "en": "The text fields always want and yield strings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 272.15999999999997,
          "end": 274.23,
          "en": "Since enteredQuantity wants a number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 274.23,
          "end": 277.86,
          "en": "we therefore must convert this value to a number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 277.86,
          "end": 281.15999999999997,
          "en": "by using int, and then here we can use parse",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 281.15999999999997,
          "end": 283.44,
          "en": "and parse the value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 283.44,
          "end": 284.97,
          "en": "The difference between parse",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 284.97,
          "end": 289.77,
          "en": "and TryParse is that parse will throw an error if it fails",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 289.77,
          "end": 291.75,
          "en": "to convert the string to a number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 291.75,
          "end": 294.69,
          "en": "whereas TryParse yields null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 294.69,
          "end": 297.87,
          "en": "But since we already checked whether TryParse yields null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 297.87,
          "end": 301.89,
          "en": "here in our validator, we can safely use parse here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 301.89,
          "end": 304.59,
          "en": "because as mentioned before, onSaved,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 304.59,
          "end": 307.08,
          "en": "this function here will only execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 307.08,
          "end": 309.36,
          "en": "if validation succeeded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 309.36,
          "end": 311.4,
          "en": "Otherwise we would not call save",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 311.4,
          "end": 314.52,
          "en": "here in our saveItem method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 314.52,
          "end": 317.28,
          "en": "Therefore it should be safe to use parse here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 317.28,
          "end": 320.25,
          "en": "And we also know that value won't be null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 320.25,
          "end": 322.68,
          "en": "Hence we can add this exclamation mark",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 322.68,
          "end": 325.653,
          "en": "because we also check for this in our validator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 326.61,
          "end": 330.33,
          "en": "And with that we're also setting the enteredQuantity.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 330.33,
          "end": 333.12,
          "en": "Now what about the DropdownButtonFormField?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 333.12,
          "end": 335.67,
          "en": "Indeed there we do have a onSaved method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 335.67,
          "end": 337.26,
          "en": "but here we'll have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 337.26,
          "end": 340.95,
          "en": "to manage the selected value manually anyways,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 340.95,
          "end": 343.89,
          "en": "also to make sure that an initial value is shown",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 343.89,
          "end": 346.44,
          "en": "because DropdownButtonFormField doesn't support",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 346.44,
          "end": 349.26,
          "en": "an initial value parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 349.26,
          "end": 352.23,
          "en": "Instead it just has a value parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 352.23,
          "end": 354.12,
          "en": "which must be updated every time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 354.12,
          "end": 355.98,
          "en": "the selection changes, though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 355.98,
          "end": 357.65999999999997,
          "en": "so that what we see on the UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 357.65999999999997,
          "end": 360.453,
          "en": "is in line with what's stored internally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 361.98,
          "end": 364.56,
          "en": "Therefore here as we did it earlier in the course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 364.56,
          "end": 367.68,
          "en": "in another section, we have to add a new variable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 367.68,
          "end": 370.74,
          "en": "for example, selectedCategory.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 370.74,
          "end": 375.57,
          "en": "And we can set this to an initial value like categories",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 375.57,
          "end": 379.383,
          "en": "using this categories list here from categories.dart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 380.64,
          "end": 383.43,
          "en": "and then there the category with an identifier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 383.43,
          "end": 385.44,
          "en": "of categories.vegetable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 385.44,
          "end": 387.55,
          "en": "And for that we have to make sure that we",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 388.65,
          "end": 391.86,
          "en": "select it like this and automatically add the import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 391.86,
          "end": 395.073,
          "en": "to the category.dart file here from the models folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 396.33,
          "end": 399.33,
